emdawnwebgpu provides CMake targets:

  find_package(Dawn CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE dawn::webgpu_dawn)

  # C++20 named module 'wgpu' (CMake 3.28+, Ninja generator)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE dawn::cpp_module)

Without CMake, pass the Emscripten port file to emcc/em++ for both compilation and linking:

  --use-port=<vcpkg_installed>/<triplet>/share/emdawnwebgpu/emdawnwebgpu.port.py
